BT 1 0 0 1 0 123 Tm 12 TL /F1 9 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Twelve persistent anomalies in solar system science -- from the flyby anomaly and anomalous lunar recession to) Tj T* ('Oumuamua's non-gravitational acceleration and the Kuiper Belt cliff -- have resisted unified explanation within standard) Tj T* (gravitational and thermodynamic frameworks. We demonstrate that each anomaly resolves within the AIIT-THRESI) Tj T* (coherence framework governed by C = C0 x exp\(-alpha x gamma_eff\), where C0 is the bare vacuum coherence, alpha is) Tj T* (the coherence-decoherence coupling constant, and gamma_eff is the effective decoherence rate determined by local) Tj T* (baryonic complexity, thermal environment, and radiative processes. The central result is the identification of the ) Tj /F2 9 Tf (solar) Tj T* (coherence horizon) Tj /F1 9 Tf ( -- the heliocentric distance at which solar-maintained vacuum coherence drops below the critical) Tj T* (threshold gamma_c required for stable matter aggregation. This horizon falls at approximately 48 AU and manifests) Tj T* (observationally as the Kuiper Belt cliff. The same coherence function, applied to planetary interiors, atmospheres, orbital) Tj T* (dynamics, and structural properties, closes all twelve anomalies without free parameters beyond those already established) Tj T* (in the AIIT-THRESI framework.) Tj T* ET
